

PCAWG_tel_ins_blacklist.tsv:

all windows with discordant reads in the control samples, with number of control samples and mean discordant reads in the window. Merged from individual cohorts.

NB_tel_ins_blacklist.tsv:

all windows with discordant reads in the control samples, with number of control samples and mean discordant reads in the window.


Typically only windows with a Freq of at least 15 are used for blacklisting the telomere repeat loci


External blacklist:
wget https://github.com/Boyle-Lab/Blacklist/raw/master/lists/hg19-blacklist.v2.bed.gz
